<title>NORWAY: Orkla 1996 profits up.</title>
<headline>Orkla 1996 profits up.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31</p>
<p>				    (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenues	   25,998	   vs	21,977</p>
<p> Operating profit		1,916	   vs	 1,784</p>
<p> Net financial items     minus 398	   vs   minus 451</p>
<p> Portfolio gains		   816	   vs	   481</p>
<p> Pre-tax profits		 2,431	   vs	 1,890</p>
<p> Taxes				 679	   vs	   458</p>
<p> Profit for the year	   1,752	   vs	 1,432</p>
<p> Dividend (crowns)		7.0	    vs	  6.00</p>
<p> EPS 1996 (crowns)	     36.5	    vs	 29.80</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of branded goods, food-based company is Orkla ASA. Ten analysts polled by Reuters expected the company to post a pre-tax profit of 2.47 billion crowns, up from 1.93 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
